# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository.
#
# Before this file existed, music.html was committed with CRLF while every other
# text file was LF, git printed "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on most edits, and
# tools/build-nav.py carried explicit code to preserve whatever ending each file
# already had rather than normalizing it. That workaround exists because of the
# inconsistency this file removes.
#
# Adopted in v2.10.2. The commit that added it renormalized all 12 pages, which
# is why that commit touches every file and changes nothing you can see.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touched, never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.mp3 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
